<title>GREECE: Greek January M3 rises provisional 13.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Greek January M3 rises provisional 13.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greek M3 money supply grew a provisional 13.8 percent year-on-year in January from 9.0 percent in December, overshooting the central bank's 6.0- to 9.0- percent target range for the end of 1997, the Bank of Greece said in a statement.</p>
</text>
